  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Lowered to 1329 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): tryProceduralHowTo renders its heading, install gate, source path and stage lines from seeded procedural_how_to_* responses and its search queries from the policy procedural_how_to block."
